The fonts in bdf/ are the X11 misc-fixed fonts from Markus Kuhn's ucs-fonts
(https://www.cl.cam.ac.uk/~mgk25/ucs-fonts.html), which are in the public
domain: "Public domain font. Share and enjoy."

The converted fonts in ttf/ and the scripts in this repository are released
into the public domain as well. Where that is not possible, they are licensed
under CC0 1.0 Universal (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).
